---
title: Soft-boiled eggs
servings: 2
tags: [breakfast, quick, basics]
source: Invented for this repository
---

Bring a #small saucepan{} of water to a rolling boil.

Lower @eggs{4} in on a spoon, one at a time, and set a timer for ~{6%minutes}.
Keep the water at a bare simmer; a hard boil cracks them.

Lift the eggs into a bowl of cold water and leave ~{60%seconds} before peeling.

Season with @flaked sea salt{} and a little @black pepper{}.
